    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/7ac9a367993deef1c7a747368e059f51.poster.avif?t=1755322636\" width=216 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/7ac9a367993deef1c7a747368e059f51.webm?t=1755322636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a Dungeon Master  in this turn-based tactics game. Make clever use of monster encounters, traps and cursed items to keep invading adventurers at bay, all while managing a demanding employer and troublesome subordinates. Experience the thrill of a soul-crushing office job in a medieval fantasy setting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/acc4d9e3fa20a5d4c01c684d42189f01.poster.avif?t=1755322636\" width=362 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/acc4d9e3fa20a5d4c01c684d42189f01.webm?t=1755322636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based tactical gameplay with multiple solutions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, bite-sized experience you can complete in a few hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters to boss around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed items with spooky lore and mind-boggling effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paperwork </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandatory unpaid overtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/4976a7f6b5e16684f9f4bc82fd716468.poster.avif?t=1755322636\" width=310 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/4976a7f6b5e16684f9f4bc82fd716468.webm?t=1755322636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/7ac9a367993deef1c7a747368e059f51.poster.avif?t=1755322636\" width=216 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/7ac9a367993deef1c7a747368e059f51.webm?t=1755322636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a Dungeon Master  in this turn-based tactics game. Make clever use of monster encounters, traps and cursed items to keep invading adventurers at bay, all while managing a demanding employer and troublesome subordinates. Experience the thrill of a soul-crushing office job in a medieval fantasy setting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/acc4d9e3fa20a5d4c01c684d42189f01.poster.avif?t=1755322636\" width=362 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/acc4d9e3fa20a5d4c01c684d42189f01.webm?t=1755322636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based tactical gameplay with multiple solutions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, bite-sized experience you can complete in a few hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters to boss around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed items with spooky lore and mind-boggling effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paperwork </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandatory unpaid overtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/4976a7f6b5e16684f9f4bc82fd716468.poster.avif?t=1755322636\" width=310 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458870/extras/4976a7f6b5e16684f9f4bc82fd716468.webm?t=1755322636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
